<title>USA: First Industrial unit to issue debt.</title>
<headline>First Industrial unit to issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Tuesday its limited partnership subsidiary, First Industrial LP, will issue $225 million in senior unsecured notes in two traunches from its existing shelf registration.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan &amp; Co is the lead representative of the underwriters in the offering. Other underwriters include Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, First Chicago Capital Markets Inc and UBS Securities.</p>
<p>First Industrial is a fully integrated real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
